kb/theory/many-to-many-edge-state-is-where-files-yield-to-a-database.md:20:Commonplace was a bounded witness until November 2026. Its v1 freshness architecture identified a `review-pair` target by target kind plus a complete target key, conceptually `(note, criterion, model_partition)`. That subsystem needed indexed current-state selection, baseline-revision compare-and-swap for stale work, coordinated finalization and refresh transitions, cross-record integrity, and lifecycle operations. The [original SQLite decision](../reference/adr/010-review-state-should-move-to-sqlite-once-reviews-leave-git-and.md) made SQLite canonical for review operational state and Markdown review artifacts derived. The [general freshness-store decision](../reference/adr/052-general-freshness-store-review-first-migration.md) extended that operational store to freshness baselines, inputs, and review evidence while retaining `review-pair` as the only v1 target. The [storage architecture](../reference/storage-architecture.md) keeps authored notes and criteria canonical in files and generated indexes derived; freshness does not adjudicate truth. This case shows that explicit requirements and a separate authority decision can justify a database for an edge-keyed operational state class. It does not show that the complete key required SQLite, that all many-to-many state belongs in a database, or that Commonplace establishes a general threshold.
kb/theory/thresholding-monotone-transforms-does-not-add-an-independent-check.md:39:- **Distribution dependence is not scalar dependence.** In the hypothetical distributions `(0.60,0.40,0.00)` and `(0.60,0.20,0.20)`, with the first option picked in both, the picked and winning probabilities are both `0.60`. Yet the top-two margins are `0.20` and `0.40`. A distribution summary can therefore distinguish cases that `p` cannot. It adds information relative to `p`, not relative to the already-known full vector. This does not identify TypeSafe's formula or show that margin predicts errors better.
kb/theory/prototype-standing-is-revision-cost-binding-plus-lost-investment.md:20:Since binding is a cost component, binding a consumer to a theory before the theory is accepted for that consumer's scope spends standing that evidence has not yet licensed. Acceptance for the bound scope licenses binding. Current fit does not, and current form does not. Executable success does not either, because [Exact implementation does not validate a requirement against its objective](./exact-implementation-does-not-validate-a-requirement.md): a passing executable shows the artifact matches its requirement, and adoption supplies authority rather than prudence. So binding is the act to withhold before acceptance for the bound scope, whatever form the theory has. Binding before acceptance may still be chosen for coordination value or forced by an enduring constraint. It is then knowingly spent standing, weighed as the current-task-fit note weighs entrenchment, which leaves the threshold open.
kb/theory/brainstorming-maintainability-oracles-for-agentic-development.md:25:This makes maintainability relational and counterfactual: code is maintainable *for some future change distribution*, not in isolation. A compact function can be harder to change than a longer explicit one; duplication can be cheaper than an abstraction when the duplicated cases will evolve independently; a dependency that looks clean locally can make the next cross-cutting change expensive. So the oracle needs a declared horizon and change distribution — without them it risks measuring conformity to a design aesthetic rather than future change cost.
kb/theory/designing-agent-memory-systems.md:60:- Consumer-specific failure modes: [create memory directly](./agent-memory-requirements/create-memory-directly.md), [import external knowledge](./agent-memory-requirements/import-external-knowledge.md), [serve multiple consumers](./agent-memory-requirements/serve-multiple-consumers.md), [activate behavior-changing memory](./agent-memory-requirements/activate-behavior-changing-memory.md), [make authority explicit](./agent-memory-requirements/make-authority-explicit.md), and [evaluate memory by effects](./agent-memory-requirements/evaluate-memory-by-effects.md).
kb/theory/designing-agent-memory-systems.md:64:- Symbolic-artifact governance: [use trace extraction](./agent-memory-requirements/use-trace-extraction-as-meta-learning.md), [activate behavior-changing memory](./agent-memory-requirements/activate-behavior-changing-memory.md), [promote only when value exceeds cost](./agent-memory-requirements/promote-only-when-value-exceeds-cost.md), [keep compiled views aligned](./agent-memory-requirements/keep-compiled-views-aligned.md), and [make authority explicit](./agent-memory-requirements/make-authority-explicit.md).
kb/theory/designing-agent-memory-systems.md:65:- Substrate versus memory-system boundary: [import external knowledge](./agent-memory-requirements/import-external-knowledge.md), [promote only when value exceeds cost](./agent-memory-requirements/promote-only-when-value-exceeds-cost.md), [keep compiled views aligned](./agent-memory-requirements/keep-compiled-views-aligned.md), [retire, redact, supersede, and relax memory](./agent-memory-requirements/retire-redact-supersede-relax.md), and [make authority explicit](./agent-memory-requirements/make-authority-explicit.md).
kb/theory/broad-software-demands-create-pressure-for-agentic-factory-development.md:43:But the right orchestration is not determined by task size alone. It depends on the task's dependency structure, the solver's effective capabilities, what information must survive between calls, which operations need exact execution, and how partial results can be checked and combined.
kb/theory/parametric-reproduction-cannot-replace-an-authoritative-record.md:31:- The central claim covers both mutable and immutable authority-bearing records. Mutability adds currentness and change-management requirements; an immutable authority-bearing decision still requires stable identity, authenticity, and attribution.
kb/theory/agent-memory-requirements/adaptation-survey-corroborates-memory-requirements.md:38:This is the gap the requirements directory fills. [Make authority explicit](./make-authority-explicit.md), [keep compiled views aligned](./keep-compiled-views-aligned.md), [promote only when future value exceeds maintenance cost](./promote-only-when-value-exceeds-cost.md), and [retire, redact, supersede, and relax memory](./retire-redact-supersede-relax.md) are mostly invisible in the survey's taxonomy, but they are load-bearing in an agent-operated KB. The survey can say that a memory curator improves downstream task performance; the requirements map asks whether the resulting memory has provenance, lineage alignment, review status, activation rules, and a retirement path.
kb/theory/any-symbolic-program-with-llm-calls-is-a-select-call-program.md:74:State-specific inverses, reactive coeffects, committed dependency views, guarded withdrawal, and recovery after an in-flight iteration show what explicit recovery, dependency, and lifecycle state can look like. The guarantees depend on correct inverses and, for whole-system results, independence, acyclic dependencies, bounded iterations, finite fibers, total provisions, and absence of failed fibers. The confluence result concerns quiescent state, not external emissions, and failures may diverge by schedule.

EXIT: 0
